  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Readable
  Title: Exhibit V - The Morvayne Tomb
  Body: 'Carved limestone, fifteenth century. The founder of the line is said to
    rest here.


    The case is sealed for the visitor''s protection.


    It does
    not open from this side.'
